{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "0626f3f635623c4f0dcad1095308aa2d3b190e187a79c62739d014be500c084d", "ja": "新たな光！　復讐の刃は愛とともに", "zh": "全新光芒！复仇之刃与爱同在", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7b91c50c019d87c0eda9c6a45b46559cc02fc72ba91a7a73e2bbf23298c0f4df", "ja": "デストルドーへの復讐に囚われていた女性・\n莉緒は、マイティセーラーあずさを尾行して\nキネティックパワーを要求するが適正なしと\n告げられる。しかし、戦闘で莉緒を庇った\nあずさの愛に共鳴し、覚醒したのだった！", "zh": "被向德斯特鲁多复仇的执念所束缚的女人——\n莉绪尾随Mighty Sailor阿梓，\n要求获得动能之力，却被告知没有适性。\n然而，在战斗中与保护了莉绪的\n阿梓的爱产生共鸣，她就此觉醒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "90e69850b534ea9ddd95fe9a4948cfc93ec0ef889943eac48f0fee94da7a85d3", "ja": "デストルドーが着々と世界を侵食する中、あずさは\n人々を守るため、日夜戦いに明け暮れていた。", "zh": "在迪斯特鲁多逐步侵蚀世界之际，梓为了保护人们，日夜不停地奋战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "9d317f1d0d3ab70eb0e7e86673bced5e772994108f5cc52e233eb3967803d931", "ja": "待ちなさい、デストルドー！\nこれ以上は私が許さないわっ！　はああっ！", "zh": "站住，死欲！\n我绝不容许你再继续下去了！喝啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1002_se", "source_sha256": "acb3286e337a365d56d62143e4aee7fa4e4cc0efc11e93e39ffc550114b650e4", "ja": "ドカーーーンッ！！", "zh": "轰——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "424f75b4f9dbcc27a1eb04656968c67a62c7d78bc01fa70384af22bcf7c47592", "ja": "そんなあずさを物陰から見つめる、\n不審な影があった……！", "zh": "在暗处注视着那样的梓，有一个可疑的身影……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "26e803fedd05cdf7d38ca854368c2593d38f48db435cef3527e11f7079a1b8ef", "ja": "あれが、噂のマイティセーラー。\nデストルドーと対等に渡り合うヒーローね……。", "zh": "那就是传闻中的Mighty Sailor。能与Destrudo势均力敌的英雄……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "3b95c1c26a3daa1ce88b64d9077dff8dd5e9def8f8192062fe3fe59ecb4544c8", "ja": "あの力があれば……私だって！", "zh": "要是有那股力量……我也能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "409487e9f1bff7c5ee8b16bc9aad815ea0c4953b5577ed0b053bf677c669ab83", "ja": "ふぅ。博士、パトロールから戻りました。\n幸い、今日はどこも異常ありません……ただ……。", "zh": "呼……博士，我巡逻回来了。\n幸好，今天到处都没有异常……不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "e568e71a6636a0c636a734c876ac1ab1c71cf25987a5f0a3aaa2a4140873901f", "ja": "はあー、はあー……！\nや、やっと突き止めたわよ、マイティセーラー！", "zh": "哈啊——哈啊……！\n终、终于让我找到你了，Mighty Sailor！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "4b6c12849ba0bfaee7f2a8b59439c867c0a378e1ddb8198b962d8f75cafcbd10", "ja": "どうしても、この人がついて来てしまって……。", "zh": "不管怎样，这个人还是跟过来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1009_president", "source_sha256": "31cbf9b3ea34ab8d78f418ff8b66286d5e2c2177e43ddb05f1aae174aab7e414", "ja": "ほほう？　飛行するあずさ君を走って尾行するとは、\nなかなかの能力と根性の持ち主じゃないか。", "zh": "哦？居然能跑着尾随飞行中的阿梓莎，你还真是个能力出众又有毅力的人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "47db1548440f388c71b8c017b8bc09bce387f1f0eab027446b36085e37e3188e", "ja": "ゲホゲホッ……ゴホンッ、余計なお世話！\nいいからその力、今すぐ私にも使わせて！", "zh": "咳咳……咳嗯，多管闲事！\n总之，赶紧让我也用用那股力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1011_president", "source_sha256": "9cf4058ce0c2631ee09080591e050a23defacaf8adcd9747703beffa1cfe2a08", "ja": "ふむ。確かに君には、かなりの力が眠っているようだ。\n……だが、決して目覚めることはないだろう。", "zh": "嗯。你体内确实沉睡着相当强大的力量。\n……但是，它绝不会觉醒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "223a687b8f14b5777e71efeabe45ef1a5b65f036f029b72c8331b09dceaa7169", "ja": "だったら目覚めさせて！　デストルドーは街中にあふれ\nてるのよ。出し惜しみしてる場合じゃないでしょ！", "zh": "既然如此，就让它觉醒啊！德斯特鲁多已经充斥街头\n了。现在可不是藏着掖着的时候吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "dd7c623a46da982a523ec35beb5625d7cd0a80c9d2db1214a1b4cb990afb087f", "ja": "あなたは……\nどうしてデストルドーと戦いたいの？", "zh": "你……为什么想和德斯特鲁多战斗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "dcf40dcdb0c4c5a66ae33c7c5e9be2c7d85b2c8a165b6ef593785240e9d6a3d4", "ja": "決まってるじゃない、デストルドーを倒すためよ！\n奴らがどれだけ人を苦しめてると思ってるの！？", "zh": "这不是明摆着的吗？当然是为了打倒德斯特鲁多！\n你知道那些家伙让多少人受苦吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "f99d549fae709efae3cf4f5409150b0a1362c4b59cd0f3d251c997a05986efce", "ja": "絶対に許さない。私の家族を殺した、あいつらを……。\n今度は、私が！", "zh": "我绝对不会原谅……那些杀害我家人的家伙。\n这一次，就由我来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "5587339d2c0a9929d363367a488aec8497fe3b8677f0f89d15abe758c5387215", "ja": "復讐ね……。気持ちはわかるわ。でも、ごめんなさい。\n今のあなたは、きっと力を扱えない。", "zh": "复仇吗……我能理解你的心情。但是，很抱歉。\n现在的你，肯定无法驾驭这份力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "51782831c40981c50130227a107916e11642a1ddc9bc6483f6c35874140c71ce", "ja": "むしろ、あなたはデストルドーになりかねない。", "zh": "倒不如说，你甚至可能会变成Destiny。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "534855cba0fb503e8449f4979a91f06b3322a875abf9ffc9a45531119e7391ed", "ja": "なんですって！？　冗談でもやめてよ！！\nどうして私が、あんな奴らに！？", "zh": "你说什么！？就算是开玩笑也别说这种话！！\n凭什么我要变成那种家伙！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1019_president", "source_sha256": "0871d4654d02fe54aa1090d0097184a8cb2d7a3244581c0854dfc42028836981", "ja": "今の君は憎しみに囚われている。\nその感情はデストル因子と容易に結びつくだろう。", "zh": "现在的你，正被憎恨所束缚。\n那种感情很容易就会与Destor因子结合吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1020_president", "source_sha256": "2eb9a8c2567c7bc166486be7d81ed2b17450c313be2fc277decacd3042af2896", "ja": "だが、キネティックパワーには『愛』が必要なのだ。\n残念だが、君からは感じられない。", "zh": "但是，动能需要“爱”才行。\n很遗憾，我感受不到你身上的爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "7898410446c71afd9bd94aac4f1e7a4e1915262c3bd4f7128535166149b13abd", "ja": "愛……？", "zh": "爱……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "5f521803706f368a4e7764f572b9ee5266283be5629154a95718dd63e9132187", "ja": "キネティックパワーは愛と正義の力。\n人々を助けたい、世界を守りたい気持ちが必要なの。", "zh": "动能是爱与正义的力量。\n需要有帮助他人、守护世界的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "0b9511a949afc3b7717f15fb54f144e5f6bde918568b4e4094f7aa0cea27ca1c", "ja": "あははっ、愛ですって？　力を独り占めしたいなら、\nもっとマシな嘘をつきなさいよ。この、偽善者ッ！", "zh": "啊哈哈，爱？你想独吞力量的话，\n好歹编个像样点的谎啊。你这个伪善者！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1024_se", "source_sha256": "2ae6fcfde8404fa07e107c73c2e98d287bf4fcbcfdc517c2bbf46194597ebc18", "ja": "ビーッ！　ビーッ！　ビーッ！", "zh": "哔——！　哔——！　哔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "bc3cd96c91294e5b7f40486f287afbc010a3ead1779bcb047d508a8d5bcb2ea5", "ja": "出動要請……！　ごめんなさい、この続きはまた。\nマイティセーラー、現場に急行します！", "zh": "出动请求……！抱歉，后面的事下次再说。\nMighty Sailor，马上赶往现场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1026_president", "source_sha256": "2f3321f8ec1e6d97482ad6a6d819501720d80a02f0a6712666aa90bc7be502ab", "ja": "うむ。あずさ君……いや、マイティセーラー！\n街の平和をどうか、よろしく頼むっ！", "zh": "嗯。梓……不，Mighty Sailor！\n城镇的和平就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "4c305786ae3156fc2be9df9222d6223aee1588dbce22a598045128639fde99b6", "ja": "そう……。また来たのね。\n奴らが、また。", "zh": "这样啊……那些家伙又来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "48221dd9fe9e1c3a6861c35efac9bf4ff7f8743152be559945c9173b6c345471", "ja": "あずさは現場に急行した。しかし、待ち受けて\nいたのはデストルドー幹部、エレナとヒビキだった！", "zh": "三浦梓赶往了现场。然而，等着她的却是德斯特鲁多干部——艾蕾娜和响！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "5ff667711bd4cdc885f5a6ae0d8e4bf0fad71d02c1017309d8b09db751f310d5", "ja": "待ってたヨ、ヒーロー！　今日はちゃーんと\nトドメを刺してあげるから、覚悟してネ！", "zh": "等你好久了，英雄！今天我可会好好给你最后一击，做好觉悟吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1030_013hib", "source_sha256": "e454422bc2a87e8c6271e50fceda2bb4ecfee94093f6314196309c22ac300b5c", "ja": "怪獣たちを暴れさせてやりたかったけど、もうやめだ。\n自分達のカンペキなダンサブル攻撃を食らうがいい！", "zh": "本来想让怪兽们大闹一场的，不过还是算了吧。\n尝尝我们完美的舞蹈攻击吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "ed2b295ccc89232a7eb2555ab40f197a203943b3ec927666dd947d3b7da957e4", "ja": "アマゾンの奥地に戻り、さらなる暗黒パワーを蓄えた\n二人の連携攻撃で、あずさはピンチに陥ってしまう！", "zh": "回到亚马逊深处，积蓄了更强黑暗力量的两人发动联合攻击，令梓陷入了危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "bc02628b9b1224b462ec047d9e8628475a577e4fc1ad728ac92e599df57f54a9", "ja": "（くっ……前より二人の力が増している。\nどうにかして、活路を切り開かないと……）", "zh": "（唔……她们两个的力量比之前更强了。得想办法杀出一条路……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "0e88886e4bfe8ea8f62bcfb09eafccaad22ecf36cc832951c56a64b3ba5d94d5", "ja": "ちょっとー！　なんであいつらに押されてるのよ！\nあなたの力は、そんなもんなの！？", "zh": "喂——！为什么会被那两个家伙压制啊！\n你的力量就只有这种程度吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ed57716853fc08d4b38e14650a4b02ef193a00b58ed96436a26fbc2a4aaa59a", "ja": "あれ？　あんなところに人がいるぞ。\nさてはマイティセーラーの友達だな？", "zh": "咦？那种地方居然有人。\n想必是强力水手的同伴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "1a23a99d102d3d7526fc5ebd62d5428a4ae415be204b503f8d1d0ce164e18804", "ja": "へぇ、それは面白いネ！\nオネーサンもダークサイドに落ちなサイッ！", "zh": "嘿，那可真有意思呢！\n大姐姐也一起堕入黑暗面吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1036_se", "source_sha256": "aee39a05f3d89f53994e93af6f9c7814f0f61ecf1023b3fa2486bff118433799", "ja": "バシュッ！！", "zh": "唰！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "5fca88aa2153c45f4a3ace48cb01089db7766d44430c32148983111b64752184", "ja": "きゃあああっ！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1038_010azu", "source_sha256": "1354dc5c82652ebb00b9a7f66fa35741e783e0843dc4e6c67a44955bec846fa1", "ja": "危ないっ！！", "zh": "危险！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1039_se", "source_sha256": "a58e4cbc0366c3cd1219d4b4042375e3c9724efd7957a3779dcd6165c1436f1c", "ja": "ザシュッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "de647a9632c0453c26c4acab8ed7668e79e27310d51d2b45b0bc16b2069c9df3", "ja": "……えっ！？　あ、あなた、どうして……？", "zh": "……咦！？你、你为什么会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1041_010azu", "source_sha256": "8cd0f395974b9420a3e79790fe37fa27bb418a9a6bb5edf0508c9ab970b557ae", "ja": "ケガは、無いわね……。よかった……。", "zh": "没有受伤吧……太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1042_046rio", "source_sha256": "008ebff563bc325821e2caf9d4c6cf8989de101b53ad37a4c7b57957983d4666", "ja": "よかったじゃないわよ！　誰も、庇ってくれなんて\n言ってない！　勝手についてきただけなのに！", "zh": "才不是“太好了”呢！又没人让你保护我！\n明明只是自作主张跟过来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "cc26bde27a2e7b79309539aac4fc471fd0672a300e0eb717dd6356ead67e58a3", "ja": "なのに……\nどうして真っ先に、私の心配をするの……？", "zh": "可是……\n为什么你却第一个担心起我来了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "ea81c9351b9a0539ccc2405c34a33925a8eabbed0fdf96869e2e5343cd1a9cac", "ja": "その時！　莉緒の中のあずさへの感謝と、深い愛への\n共鳴が、マイティセーラースーツと感応した！！", "zh": "就在那时！莉绪心中对梓的感激，以及对这份深沉爱意的共鸣，与Mighty Sailor服装产生了感应！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1045_null", "source_sha256": "b23b388c7e3371510fb4912aa5694cea30e6c1c3c4ba0fd3a88aa4ec56938caf", "ja": "ピカーッ！", "zh": "闪亮——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "f8b77464fb8dda01f445b69f7cb0b023ecca8798c5d750263f406a99300e7730", "ja": "へっ？　な、なんなの、この光！？\nちか、力が、奪われてく……うぎゃああああ！！", "zh": "哎？这、这光是怎么回事！？\n力、力量被夺走了……呜哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "1d1394338b59c15def8c6aebf65eed13d756b007bf29b99636b4a857deb25013", "ja": "莉緒のキネティックパワーの覚醒により、\n周囲のデストル因子が中和されていく！！", "zh": "随着莉緒的动能力量觉醒，周围的德斯特鲁因子正在被中和！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1048_018ele", "source_sha256": "ad75c928e457d217af719f05aa0d5ff338f6ef1f9deefd30073f748a55858b42", "ja": "キャアアア！　ヒビキ、ここは一時撤退だヨー！\nアーディオース！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊！响，这里先暂时撤退吧——！\n再会！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "d270c9b8b2683373d8b64e8ac1f55bf66d9b6273a6e9c799b7ad111c63911128", "ja": "こうしてついに、\n二人目のヒーローが誕生したのだった！！", "zh": "就这样，第二位英雄终于诞生了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_03_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "c531535a1e5bf9ac7c1d356f39b2d96b393846a5665ec51da0c84ab1ea898bd9", "ja": "次回『恐怖！　暗黒の手品師ジョーカー卿襲来！』\n……ううっ、ページをめくる手が止まりません！", "zh": "下回《恐怖！黑暗魔术师小丑爵士来袭》\n……呜呜，翻页的手根本停不下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
